#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/library/ingest-derive-content.bpmn:87
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Applies equally to an image EXTRACTED FROM A PDF (Task_FiguresTables), not only to an uploaded one. An agent opens every image and vector render and records a verdict in the library's image-verdicts.json: role (figure, logo or decorative), the reason, and a draft description in English plus ar, zh, es, fr and ru, which the apply-image-verdicts.ts arm lays over images.json on every ingest. Images judged figure are kept as WebP, quality 80, at most 1600 px; logos, decorative fragments and page scans are not. Every description stays a draft until a person confirms it with `bun run cat narratives`. Method: skill document-intake, \"Figures and captioned tables: describe, keep, transcribe\"."
msgstr ""

